{"slug":"ASIS","companyName":"ASIS International","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/asis-international","fetchedAt":"2026-10-25T22:14:34Z","followerCount":102629,"bio":"The world's largest association for security professionals, ASIS International has 243 chapters around the globe. Wherever you are in your career, whether just getting started or a seasoned security professional, ASIS International has the tools, information, and global network you need to achieve your goals. Put the power of ASIS to work for you.  www.asisonline.org","recentPosts":[{"date":"2026-03-05","text":"Our #MyASIS community is unmatched. We are in awe of our members\u2019 dedication to the profession and each other, who are always looking for ways to support their colleagues and friends. In honor of Membership Appreciation Month we ask that you share your appreciation for your fellow members, maybe someone who has influenced your career or helped you in your ASIS journey? Tag a member in the comments below and be entered to win a FREE GSX All-Access Pass to #GSX2026. #ASISMemberAppreciation","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/asis-international/home/"},{"date":"2026-10-21","text":"Deepfakes, synthetic identities, and targeted phishing are putting pressure on financial institutions. On 4 November, Security Solutions Spotlight: Banking & Finance brings you practical strategies to strengthen your banking and finance security posture, with insights from the sector\u2019s foremost experts.\nExpect four live sessions, each followed by Q&A. Free for members and nonmembers.\nRegister now: https://bit.ly/4jowxiG\n#ASISInternational #Deepfakes #FraudPrevention #FinancialServices","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/asis-international/home/"},{"date":"2026-10-24","text":"How are cities moving from reactive, manual investigations to real-time, data-driven public safety, and how is the same infrastructure making them smarter, not just safer?\nGet the answers from Nathan Hale and Brian Ison, CPP, CFE during ASIS\u2019s next webinar, Securing the Future: Cities Across North America.\nExpect standout moments, hard numbers, and an honest look at what separates the cities that are getting it right: open platforms, community trust, and technology deployed as part of a plan.\nFree to all | Registration required\nThursday, 29 October 2026 | 12:30 pm ET | 1 CPE\nSponsored by Milestone Systems\nRegister now: https://lnkd.in/egqk4nYr\n#SmartCity #PublicSafety #RealTimeCrime #ASISInternational","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/asis-international/home/"},{"date":"2026-10-23","text":"Violent incidents remain low compared to previous years, but organizations aren\u2019t letting their guard down. In a new ASIS and Everbridge study, less than half of respondents  are highly or mostly confident their staff know what to do in an active assailant incident.\nThe research points to four factors linked to higher confidence in an organization\u2019s preparedness: a comprehensive plan, regular drills, communications technology, and an effective behavioral threat assessment and management (BTAM) team.\nRead the full Security Management article: https://bit.ly/4zHrXkj\nAuthor: Scott Briscoe\n#ASISInternational #ThreatAssessment #BTAM #EmergencyManagement #WorkplaceSafety","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/asis-international/home/"},{"date":"2026-10-20","text":"IT sets policies that affect your team with minimal input. Compliance findings surface issues you couldn\u2019t see. Change windows follow IT\u2019s timelines, not yours.\nThe gap between physical security and IT is a governance and communication problem, made worse by limited visibility into the device estate. Join this session to learn how physical security leaders can close that gap by leading the conversations on device ownership, visibility, and governance.\nFree to all | Registration required\nThursday, 22 October 2026 | 12:30 pm ET | 1 CPE\nRegister now: https://bit.ly/4BmlOvN\nSpeaker: Roy Dagan\nSponsored by SecuriThings\n#ASISInternational","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/asis-international/home/"}]}
